<title>JAPAN: Shin-Daiwa Kogyo 3-mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Shin-Daiwa Kogyo 3-mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  5.10		18.11</p>
<p> Current	    150    million	 521    million</p>
<p> Net		   70    million	 210    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.93 yen	   8.81 yen</p>
<p> Ord div		1.50 yen	   5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin-Daiwa Kogyo Co Ltd is leading manufacturer</p>
<p>of electric motor and engine chain saws. The latest</p>
<p>forecasts were for the period starting December 21, 1996</p>
<p>to March 31, 1997. The actual results were for the full</p>
<p>year to December 20, 1996, because the company changed</p>
<p>its business term.</p>
</text>
